{0E}*  Next Lecture: Practical Magic Strategy (2)      *
*      Lecturer: Kathleen                          *
*      Eligible: Past attendees; Year 2 completed  *{0F}{w}{p}Could it be a popular lecture?{w}{p}Further down there is a waiting list, with what look like students' names written across several pages.{w}{p}Looking closely, you see Soara's name at the top of the attendee list.{w}

"Heh heh heh~
That's nowhere near good enough!"{w}{p}"Don't you go underestimating
Professor Nambino!"{w}

As you were about to leave,
Professor Nambino was munching away in front of you.{w}{p}Something stick-shaped was poking out
of the professor's mouth.{w}

"U-um, say...{w}That thing you have, it's an Angel's... Window, right?"{w}{p}"N-normally,
I'd beat you guys to a pulp right here,
b-but I'm in a good mood today."{w}{p}"If you give me the Angel's Window,{w}m-maybe I'll let you off...?{w}Ahahaha..."{w}

"Spells that raise and lower spell resistance
are a pain to calculate."{w}{p}"{11:0001:0041}
multiplies spell resistance by 1.5."{w}{p}"{11:0001:0045}
multiplies spell resistance by 0.7."{w}{p}"So even if you cast both the same number of times,
it won't necessarily go back to the original value...{w}Sigh, and I'm bad with numbers, too."{w}

{0E}*          Year 3 Completion Exam          *
*                   and                    *
*  Rubenburg Magic School Graduation Exam  *{0F}{w}

"No.{w}If anything, we are lower than livestock."{w}{p}"Sorcery is a Reading school of magic,
one that glimpses the power of the gods...
no, the very world of the gods."{w}{p}"The more one deciphers the knowledge, information and laws of the gods' world, the closer one can come, indirectly, to the thinking of the gods."{w}{p}"And the conclusion I reached from all that...{w}is that the gods have not prepared the land for our sake."{w}

"It seems they expect something to be born from this land,
or else to appear, or arise...
something of that sort."{w}{p}"Our being here is nothing more than a condition for that possibility."{w}

Before you, a number of eerie tentacles
brimming with baleful power
came dancing out.{w}
